@style(../styles/IDocDemo.style)
@title(Charts: Distribution)

How values are spread: histograms, box plots, strips and Q-Q plots. Each chart is followed by the source that drew it, and every example carries its own data.

@table(widths=equal)
@row
@cell
@b{Histogram}

How one column's values are spread. `bins=` sets the resolution.

@graph(type=histogram, x=score, bins=8, title="Exam scores")
